From: Pixelado Dev <350114043+pixeladodev@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Room engine: launched by Pixelado Party's room, already in its session

room.ctl: the room's local socket. The engine says HELLO, then listening (host)
or connected (guest) once its local wireless session is up, and GAME when it
ends; END from the room quits the game as a shutdown does and exits with 10.
wifi.local_join_retry_s: a join:<address> whose host isn't listening yet is
tried again when its beacon is heard. firmware.color, and firmware.profile=on
to write the nickname and the colour into the user's own firmware's working
copy too; the nickname goes in as UTF-8 (ñ, é) rather than byte by byte.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
